-- two laws: C9 and C4
WORKFLOW bad ( DEFINITION_VERSION "0.1.0", ZQL "x/app.zql", SURFACES "x.face", CALENDAR c VERSION "1", LOCALE fr )
RATIONALE "Two laws broken in one file."
ACTOR a ROLE r SEGREGATED_FROM a
STEP go
  INVOKES do_it
  IRREVERSIBLE
  ON COMMITTED -> fini
  ON REJECTED  -> fini
  RATIONALE "ON HELD is missing."
TERMINAL fini OUTCOME SUCCESS RATIONALE "Done."
